SetTransferRule_Captable_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the company Governor
│   └── it should revert with OnlyGovernor
├── when the class does not exist
│   └── it should revert with UnknownClass
├── when the class is frozen
│   └── it should revert with FrozenClass
├── when the rule is Custom and the rule contract is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with InvalidClass
└── when the rule is valid
    ├── it should store the rule
    └── it should emit TransferRuleSet
